15:28.330 --> 15:30.380
What about this one, Shino-san?

15:30.380 --> 15:31.860
You picked one for me, too?

15:31.860 --> 15:33.640
Hold it! This one's better!

15:33.640 --> 15:35.080
Why do you care, Sakisaki?

15:35.080 --> 15:38.710
Flat-chested girls wear 
micro maid bikinis! That's the rule!

15:38.710 --> 15:39.700
It is?

15:39.700 --> 15:42.140
I love them, at least!

15:42.140 --> 15:43.730
You idiot.

15:43.730 --> 15:45.300
So which one are you buying?

15:45.300 --> 15:47.430
The cloth is way too small on that one!

15:47.430 --> 15:48.570
Of course it is!

15:48.570 --> 15:51.570
I want you to wear it because it's so pervy!

15:48.570 --> 15:51.570
<b>Thump</b>

15:48.570 --> 15:51.570
<b>Thump</b>

15:49.440 --> 15:51.570
<b>Thump</b>

15:49.730 --> 15:51.570
<b>Thump</b>

15:53.540 --> 15:54.800
Damn it!

15:56.640 --> 15:57.940
Saki-chan...

15:58.500 --> 16:00.680
<i>Sakisaki's is out of the question,</i>

16:00.680 --> 16:05.290
<i>but should I take the one I chose 
or the one Mukai-kun chose for me?</i>

16:06.100 --> 16:10.250
<i>I can't let them find out 
how I feel about Mukai-kun,</i>

16:10.800 --> 16:14.720
<i>but if it'll draw his attention 
even just a little...</i>

16:20.960 --> 16:22.850
Thank you very much.

16:23.730 --> 16:27.190
<i>I can just tell them I liked the design.</i>

16:27.620 --> 16:31.440
<i>No one's going to find out 
about how I feel just from this.</i>

16:32.690 --> 16:34.030
Hey, hey...

16:34.910 --> 16:36.280
Hoshizaki-san.

16:36.280 --> 16:38.410
I've been thinking for a while now...

16:39.330 --> 16:42.620
You have a crush on Naoya, don't you?

16:44.620 --> 16:49.630
<i>Girlfriend, Girlfriend</i>

16:44.980 --> 16:49.630
<i>If I buy it and bring it with me, 
I might be able to get her to wear it.</i>

16:52.060 --> 16:53.460
Am I right?

16:54.270 --> 16:56.660
<i>How did she find out?</i>

16:56.660 --> 16:59.050
<i>I-I need to change the subject!</i>

16:59.430 --> 17:02.890
I-Is it because I bought the 
swimsuit Mukai-kun chose?

17:03.210 --> 17:06.040
I just happened to like the design!

17:06.040 --> 17:08.850
It's not because I want Mukai-kun to like me!

17:10.580 --> 17:12.610
Look how desperate you are! Hilarious!

17:12.610 --> 17:14.690
I'm not desperate!

17:15.020 --> 17:16.650
What's up, Shino?

17:17.280 --> 17:18.820
Sakisaki!

17:18.820 --> 17:20.180
I, er...

17:21.160 --> 17:23.000
B-Bathroom!

17:23.000 --> 17:24.400
With Hoshizaki-san!

17:29.390 --> 17:32.520
Like I said, it's not what you think.

17:32.520 --> 17:34.880
Oh, come on. I already know.

17:35.240 --> 17:36.970
That's a misunderstanding!

17:37.290 --> 17:41.300
You tried to seduce Naoya when 
you slept with him, didn't you?

17:41.620 --> 17:43.010
How did you know?!

17:43.700 --> 17:46.380
Would you ever consider me?

17:47.680 --> 17:49.190
Thought so.

17:49.890 --> 17:51.810
You set me up?!

17:52.320 --> 17:55.580
Naoya was acting weird after he slept with you.

17:55.580 --> 17:57.340
I thought it was suspicious.

17:57.340 --> 17:59.530
I thought you might have done something.

18:00.350 --> 18:03.860
You wouldn't do that to a guy 
you didn't even like, would you?

18:03.860 --> 18:06.870
Th-That was just to test 
Mukai-kun for Sakisaki's sake.

18:06.870 --> 18:09.500
To make sure he wouldn't mess with other girls.

18:09.500 --> 18:12.420
I guess I'll tell Saki about it, then.

18:12.420 --> 18:13.460
Wait!

18:13.460 --> 18:14.420
What's wrong?

18:14.420 --> 18:16.750
I thought you did it for Saki's sake.

18:16.750 --> 18:19.700
P-Please. Don't tell her.

18:20.770 --> 18:22.550
Why not?

18:22.550 --> 18:24.470
W-Well...

18:24.470 --> 18:27.670
Mirika's too stupid to understand.

18:27.670 --> 18:29.000
<i>She pisses me off!</i>

18:29.000 --> 18:32.330
I don't get it, 
so maybe I should just tell her.

18:32.330 --> 18:34.450
<i>How did it come to this?!</i>

18:37.040 --> 18:38.400
Y-You're right.

18:40.430 --> 18:45.320
I like Mukai-kun.

18:46.180 --> 18:48.180
You finally admit it.

18:48.180 --> 18:50.140
But please keep it a secret!

18:50.140 --> 18:54.290
I can't let anyone find out that 
I have a crush on my friend's boyfriend!

18:55.340 --> 18:56.540
Sure.

18:59.380 --> 19:02.090
Form an alliance with me, then.

19:03.040 --> 19:04.700
Wh-What do you mean?

19:05.630 --> 19:10.890
Make sure I get lots of time alone 
with Naoya during the trip.

19:11.380 --> 19:15.910
In other words, do everything 
I tell you to do. Serve me.

19:15.910 --> 19:17.760
That's just slavery!

19:17.760 --> 19:20.110
You could call it that.

19:20.470 --> 19:22.990
Who knows what you'll make me do?!

19:23.340 --> 19:26.460
Do you really think you have a say in this?

19:26.460 --> 19:29.450
"I wike you, Mukai-kun!"

19:31.820 --> 19:34.740
Though, if you turn out to be 
more useful than I expect,

19:34.740 --> 19:39.380
I'll make sure you get some 
time alone with him, too.

19:40.720 --> 19:45.110
With Mukai-kun? On the beach? Alone?

19:47.950 --> 19:51.120
You want a shot, don't you?

19:51.120 --> 19:53.750
So let's work together.

19:55.740 --> 19:58.760
You don't want to just watch 
with your finger in your mouth

19:58.760 --> 20:01.730
as they get closer to him, do you?

20:02.180 --> 20:04.310
W-Well...

20:04.310 --> 20:06.780
I've never been to Okinawa before!

20:06.780 --> 20:08.460
I can't wait.

20:08.460 --> 20:10.120
Let's make plenty of memories!

20:10.120 --> 20:11.020
Yes!

20:11.020 --> 20:12.450
What should we do first?

20:19.820 --> 20:21.240
All right, fine.

20:21.820 --> 20:23.350
I'll cooperate.

20:23.350 --> 20:25.130
Nice.

20:25.510 --> 20:28.360
Man, you call yourself 
a friend, but in reality,

20:28.360 --> 20:31.130
you're stealing your friend's boyfriend.

20:31.130 --> 20:33.600
You're pretty trashy, aren't you?

20:33.600 --> 20:35.560
I-It's not like that!

20:36.560 --> 20:39.210
What, then? Are you angling for a three-timing?

20:39.210 --> 20:40.770
Not that, either!

20:41.810 --> 20:42.890
<i>Huh?</i>

20:42.890 --> 20:46.740
<i>What am I really trying to do, then?</i>

20:47.940 --> 20:53.800
I just can't refuse and have 
you telling the others.

20:54.160 --> 20:57.240
Okay, I guess you don't need 
time with Naoya, then.

20:57.240 --> 20:58.620
W-Wait!

20:58.620 --> 21:00.210
I'm kidding.

21:01.580 --> 21:07.180
A-Also, are you really okay with 
giving me more time with Mukai-kun

21:07.180 --> 21:10.390
and him ending up falling in love with me?

21:10.390 --> 21:12.600
Huh? What are you talking about?

21:13.160 --> 21:15.990
You can't even tell the guy 
you like that you like him.

21:15.990 --> 21:18.310
You're no rival.

21:19.770 --> 21:24.770
Naoya hardly even budges against my advances.

21:24.770 --> 21:30.740
You're just a loser trying to rely on luck. 
What could you possibly do?

21:31.240 --> 21:34.470
Did you actually think you had a chance?

21:35.510 --> 21:37.530
No way! Seriously?

21:37.530 --> 21:40.170
That's hilarious!

21:40.470 --> 21:43.040
I-I'm not letting you have him!

21:43.340 --> 21:45.990
I don't think you can stop me.

21:45.990 --> 21:47.670
Don't cry, though.

21:47.670 --> 21:49.030
You're so intense.

21:49.030 --> 21:50.260
I <i>can</i> get ahead of you!

21:50.260 --> 21:55.750
I mean, it'd be nice if you got 
in the way of the others.

21:56.300 --> 21:58.100
Well, for the time being...

22:06.370 --> 22:07.990
I look forward to your cooperation.

22:09.200 --> 22:10.520
Ow!

22:11.030 --> 22:13.540
<b><b>Day of the trip</b></b>

22:18.390 --> 22:21.510
And off to Okinawa!

22:22.000 --> 22:27.010
<b>Unyielding Feelings</b>

23:57.460 --> 23:59.510
Next episode preview, but it's on Risapon TV!

23:59.510 --> 24:01.680
Today's the day of the Okinawa trip!

24:01.680 --> 24:04.680
There's something I want 
to accomplish on this trip!

24:04.680 --> 24:07.020
Onee-chan's greatest rival might be Nagisa-san.

24:07.020 --> 24:09.480
We can't let Mirika-san have her way!

24:09.480 --> 24:12.030
I'm sorry in advance about my sister!
